dAt":"2026-11-04T07:18:03.634Z","revision":1,"baseline":false,"summary":"","summaryType":"title-only","sources":[{"id":"eyou:search","name":"驱动之家","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1LWk00V2VMZWZIQlZDMF9aSS1jT09JZFAwUWU3U2dlVlI1Skktd0x3NEFWaU1Qdi1rT3hGQmExM3VMUWVfVnVkZXppT2t0TVJQQXZwZ2JWanI?oc=5","publishedAt":"2026-11-04T06:45:00.000Z","material":"search-title","checkedAt":"2026-11-04T07:18:03.634Z"}]},{"id":"905f31b4cf7f10e06344","companyId":"eyou","title":"机器人执行器 FOC 控制详解：磁场定向控制如何工作","kind":"other","stage":"reported","round":null,"amount":null,"financingType":null,"role":"subject","evidence":"official","publishedAt":"2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","occurredAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-04T08:18:52.405Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-04T08:18:52.405Z","revision":1,"baseline":false,"summary":"FOC 控制（Field-Oriented Control，磁场定向控制，又称矢量控制）是一种三相电机的电流控制方法。它把定子电流换算到随转子旋转的两根轴上，得到决定磁通和决定力矩的两个分量，再分别调节。对机器人执行器来说，这样电机力矩就近似正比于一个被控电流。本文讲解 FOC 算法的工作过程、它在电流环、速度环和位置环中的位置、转子角度的获取方式，以及规格书上哪些数字反映控制效果，并以意优 PHU、RHU、RP 执行器为例。本文的 FOC 仅指电机控制，在其他领域这个缩写还","summaryType":"source-excerpt","sources":[{"id":"eyou:official","name":"公司官网与新闻入口","url":"https://eyoubot.com/blog/foc-control-robot-actuator","publishedAt":"2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","material":"official-page","checkedAt":"2026-11-04T08:18:52.405Z"}]},{"id":"579a37b42cf09406b7fa","companyId":"eyou","title":"意优科技与大东集团签MOU，合资建线攻关农业关节模组","kind":"other","stage":"reported","round":null,"amount":null,"financingType":null,"role":"subject","evidence":"discovery","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T13:12:15.000Z","occurredAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-03T13:18:04.882Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T19:17:55.699Z","revision":4,"baseline":false,"summary":"","summaryType":"title-only","sources":[{"id":"eyou:search","name":"汽车之家","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFA3aFBVUzNKcUZZMTQ5TWgwb2NHaVpFMzc5R2l0cDNweERiWVZpVno2ZnJISlpxS01Zcmp3bklNa01mLTRRLVBZUTRvbVYzUFNFWFRrNklMU2dLM2c?oc=5","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T13:12:07.000Z","materi